Dispatched 2026-09-07 via dispatch-codex.sh at --effort high. pgid 40092, worktree .worktrees/eshyra-itnm on branch eshyra-itnm (cut from eshyra-kusc), log .worktrees/.dispatch/eshyra-itnm.log. Child env carries ESHYRA_SEAT_ROLE=dispatched-worker ESHYRA_DISPATCH_CHILD=eshyra-itnm.
DISPATCH DIED MID-PROTOCOL, COMPLETED BY THE SUPERVISOR. The Codex run wrote all ten deliverables and then exited on an internal error (codex_models_manager: 'failed to refresh available models: timeout waiting for child process to exit', 05:18:51Z) before running verification, committing, recording notes, or closing. Nothing was committed by the child. Reconciled from live state: process group 40092 gone, bead still in_progress, worktree dirty with uncommitted files.

Supervisor review of that output found four defects, two of them live behind a green 18-test suite:
(1) seat state resolved to dirname(git-common-dir)/eshyra-seats, i.e. the WORKING TREE - handoffs would appear in git status and could be committed into the repository they must never become part of;
(2) fixing (1) exposed a second bug: resolving repository CONTENT from the common dir sends every linked worktree back to the parent checkout, where a not-yet-merged seat script does not exist, so the seat silently never loads. State and content roots are now derived separately - state from the common dir so worktrees agree, content from git rev-parse --show-toplevel so a worktree runs its own code;
(3) the installed Codex shim computed a checkout then ignored it for a hardcoded install-time path;
(4) statusMessage sat on the matcher table instead of the hook handler, where it never renders.
Also added --check reporting of Codex hook trust, because an untrusted Codex hook is skipped SILENTLY and is indistinguishable from a working one.

Added the regression evidence the original suite lacked: state resolves inside the git common dir and leaves git status clean, state and content roots stay distinct, and seat-handoff round-trips and rejects unknown seat ids (including 'claude-main').

Commits 1a8a5bf and 1634cbd on branch eshyra-itnm; merged into eshyra-kusc at f39d089. Full npm run verify:worktree green on both branches (4943 passed, 20 documented skips). Closing per AGENTS.md: this bead's deliverable was a commit on its branch, and that commit landed.
